# CineConnect Alembic Database Migrations

This directory contains version-controlled database schema migration scripts.

## Common Migration Commands

### Create a new migration revision
```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "create user and profile tables"
```

### Apply all pending migrations (upgrade to latest)
```bash
alembic upgrade head
```

### Revert the most recent migration
```bash
alembic downgrade -1
```

### View migration history
```bash
alembic history --verbose
```

### Check current database revision
```bash
alembic current
```
